      "kind": "text",
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "size": 11.5,
      "text": "The road bent twice before it reached the river, and by the second bend Mara had stopped counting the fences. Her bag was lighter than it had been that morning, though she could not say what she had left behind.",
      "tracking": 0
    },
    {
      "alignment": "justified",
